  "recipe": {
    "method": "Brute: heavy body bulked like the barbarian but hostile, bare painted skin, huge spiked hide pauldron, red ragged kilt and cape, raider-family helm with bull horns, stone maul on weapon_socket carried two-handed in Melee_Brute. Procedural meshes, atlas and skin weights from Art/rig-pilot/cast/scripts (build_foes.py, cast_foes.py) on the r001 skeleton; the ten shared hand-keyed clips of Art/rig-pilot/r001/scripts/clips.py plus Brace (brace.py); Melee_Brute from overrides_foes.py (a reuse of overrides.py's IK solver); no external motion data",
    "approved_reference": "Gate 1 decision on #140 (25-bone skeleton); #147 pilot contract (Art/rig-pilot/r001/README.md); #150 foe batch design calls by the graphics lead (hostile palette family, silhouettes, height bands, rigged Rim 1.2 and Fill 1.0); #188 encounter-identity contract for the skirmisher, brute and warden roles",
