      "vertex_color": "COLOR_0 RGBA, alpha = glow mask",
      "lods": "LOD0 with clips; LOD1 and LOD2 as separate skinned glbs without clips",
      "clips": "ten: Idle, Walk, Melee, Ranged, Cast, Hit, Downed, Death, Recover, Brace; plus the class override Melee_Brute (replaces Melee, 30 frames)",
